    },
    {
      "id": "-dit0_ftTEkVMOoLwJU80",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 210.45675026856588,
      "y": 2695.495561619055,
      "width": 251.727783203125,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1773527135,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1785251473,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213305040,
      "created": 1791213303635,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "### From tables to parameters",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "### From tables to parameters",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3kNu9Ysox9Cc2vs_2C4hZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40.255102758777866,
      "y": 2735.495561619055,
      "width": 753.1514892578125,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 492706065,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1650026239,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213305040,
      "created": 1791213303636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The simplest way to move from a table to a generalizing representation is to describe each\nstate–action pair with a **feature vector** $\\displaystyle \\phi(s,a) \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ and to\ncompute the value as a weighted sum of the features:",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The simplest way to move from a table to a generalizing representation is to describe each state–action pair with a **feature vector** $\\displaystyle \\phi(s,a) \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ and to compute the value as a weighted sum of the features:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ZOh0aCSjW842gosKCNPhk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -35.918982153309116,
      "y": 2855.495561619055,
      "width": 744.479248046875,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 33062015,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 395562097,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213305040,
      "created": 1791213303636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "$\\displaystyle Q(s,a;\\theta) = \\theta^\\top \\phi(s,a) = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\theta_i\\, \\phi_i(s,a)$",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "$\\displaystyle Q(s,a;\\theta) = \\theta^\\top \\phi(s,a) = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\theta_i\\, \\phi_i(s,a)$",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TT4n62xBNZNS97v7ws9V5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -62.287085180652866,
      "y": 2865.495561619055,
      "width": 797.2154541015625,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 356175601,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 900869919,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213305040,
      "created": 1791213303636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The vector $\\displaystyle \\theta \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ collects the **parameters** of the\napproximator (in this and in the following chapters $\\displaystyle \\theta$ always denotes the\nparameters of a value function or of a network, not the stopping tolerance of Chapter 03). From now\non, learning a value function means adjusting $\\displaystyle \\theta$, not filling cells. Two\nobservations make this **linear function approximation** the reference point for everything that\nfollows.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The vector $\\displaystyle \\theta \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ collects the **parameters** of the approximator (in this and in the following chapters $\\displaystyle \\theta$ always denotes the parameters of a value function or of a network, not the stopping tolerance of Chapter 03). From now on, learning a value function means adjusting $\\displaystyle \\theta$, not filling cells. Two observations make this **linear function approximation** the reference point for everything that follows.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5ayV46b7Skd5MuGDnGfug",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -58.82306540526224,
      "y": 2995.495561619055,
      "width": 790.2874145507812,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 198349983,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1495471697,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213305040,
      "created": 1791213303637,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "First, **the table is a special case**. If $\\displaystyle \\phi(s,a)$ is the one-hot vector that is\n$\\displaystyle 1$ in the position of the pair $\\displaystyle (s,a)$ and $\\displaystyle 0$ elsewhere,\nthen $\\displaystyle \\theta^\\top \\phi(s,a)$ is simply the entry $\\displaystyle \\theta_{(s,a)}$ of\nthe table: tabular methods are linear function approximation with $\\displaystyle n = \\lvert\n\\mathcal{S} \\rvert\\, \\lvert \\mathcal{A} \\rvert$ independent parameters and no generalization. With\nfewer parameters than pairs, $\\displaystyle n \\ll \\lvert \\mathcal{S} \\rvert\\, \\lvert \\mathcal{A}\n\\rvert$, pairs that share features share parameters, and an update made for one pair also changes\nthe value of every pair with similar features. This is exactly the **generalization** we need and, as\nwe will see, also the source of new difficulties.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "First, **the table is a special case**. If $\\displaystyle \\phi(s,a)$ is the one-hot vector that is $\\displaystyle 1$ in the position of the pair $\\displaystyle (s,a)$ and $\\displaystyle 0$ elsewhere, then $\\displaystyle \\theta^\\top \\phi(s,a)$ is simply the entry $\\displaystyle \\theta_{(s,a)}$ of the table: tabular methods are linear function approximation with $\\displaystyle n = \\lvert \\mathcal{S} \\rvert\\, \\lvert \\mathcal{A} \\rvert$ independent parameters and no generalization. With fewer parameters than pairs, $\\displaystyle n \\ll \\lvert \\mathcal{S} \\rvert\\, \\lvert \\mathcal{A} \\rvert$, pairs that share features share parameters, and an update made for one pair also changes the value of every pair with similar features. This is exactly the **generalization** we need and, as we will see, also the source of new difficulties.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1CAaIpUQVWrc0SlHVewW4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 105.12087380372213,
      "y": 3295.495561619055,
      "width": 462.3995361328125,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1069926609,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 251458367,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213305040,
      "created": 1791213303637,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Second, **the gradient of a linear approximator is trivial**:",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Second, **the gradient of a linear approximator is trivial**:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "w6SXSxhWouT1GMRSRguLs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 114.42485939942526,
      "y": 3355.495561619055,
      "width": 443.79156494140625,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1593092287,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 569254961,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213305040,
      "created": 1791213303637,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "$\\displaystyle \\nabla_\\theta Q(s,a;\\theta) = \\phi(s,a)$",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "$\\displaystyle \\nabla_\\theta Q(s,a;\\theta) = \\phi(s,a)$",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TOWEpWA93r6HIr8qao4AP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -53.350988989246616,
      "y": 3395.495561619055,
      "width": 779.34326171875,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 915834545,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1452946271,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213305040,
      "created": 1791213303637,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "so the incremental update pattern of the whole course, $\\displaystyle \\text{NewEstimate}\n\\leftarrow \\text{OldEstimate} + \\text{StepSize} \\times (\\text{Target} - \\text{OldEstimate})$,\nbecomes an update of the parameters in the direction of the features:",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "so the incremental update pattern of the whole course, $\\displaystyle \\text{NewEstimate} \\leftarrow \\text{OldEstimate} + \\text{StepSize} \\times (\\text{Target} - \\text{OldEstimate})$, becomes an update of the parameters in the direction of the features:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quwgPyhTp4S3J01dQJAfo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -41.767004614246616,
      "y": 3505.495561619055,
      "width": 756.17529296875,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 150943967,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 500987409,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213305040,
      "created": 1791213303637,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "$\\displaystyle \\theta \\leftarrow \\theta + \\alpha\\, \\big[ \\text{Target} - Q(s,a;\\theta) \\big]\\,\n\\phi(s,a)$",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "$\\displaystyle \\theta \\leftarrow \\theta + \\alpha\\, \\big[ \\text{Target} - Q(s,a;\\theta) \\big]\\, \\phi(s,a)$",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3NoZHPOrtxKisalNDNkHj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -61.29498923338724,
      "y": 3555.495561619055,
      "width": 795.2312622070312,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1951697041,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 349859711,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213305040,
      "created": 1791213303637,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A neural network is a **non-linear** function approximator: the features are no longer designed by\nhand but learned by the hidden layers, and the output layer is linear in those learned features. The\nupdate rule keeps exactly the same form, with $\\displaystyle \\nabla_\\theta Q(s,a;\\theta)$\ncomputed by backpropagation in place of $\\displaystyle \\phi(s,a)$. The price is that the convergence\nguarantees available for the linear case are lost.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A neural network is a **non-linear** function approximator: the features are no longer designed by hand but learned by the hidden layers, and the output layer is linear in those learned features. The update rule keeps exactly the same form, with $\\displaystyle \\nabla_\\theta Q(s,a;\\theta)$ computed by backpropagation in place of $\\displaystyle \\phi(s,a)$. The price is that the convergence guarantees available for the linear case are lost.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UzJaTSZZ7aGolMEoiXkdU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 403.5069865995704,
      "y": 2830.983833550967,
      "width": 251.727783203125,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 37084095,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 1575522193,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213314209,
      "created": 1791213309437,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "### From tables to parameters",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "### From tables to parameters",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ZWVJfzxkm36vtLeTH4NnQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 152.79513357222663,
      "y": 2870.983833550967,
      "width": 753.1514892578125,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1232470961,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 1045868031,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213314209,
      "created": 1791213309438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The simplest way to move from a table to a generalizing representation is to describe each\nstate–action pair with a **feature vector** $\\displaystyle \\phi(s,a) \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ and to\ncompute the value as a weighted sum of the features:",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The simplest way to move from a table to a generalizing representation is to describe each state–action pair with a **feature vector** $\\displaystyle \\phi(s,a) \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ and to compute the value as a weighted sum of the features:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5OMsc8FQP56A39Xud4EM3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 157.13125417769538,
      "y": 2990.983833550967,
      "width": 744.479248046875,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 866257887,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 2050127217,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213314209,
      "created": 1791213309438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "$\\displaystyle Q(s,a;\\theta) = \\theta^\\top \\phi(s,a) = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\theta_i\\, \\phi_i(s,a)$",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "$\\displaystyle Q(s,a;\\theta) = \\theta^\\top \\phi(s,a) = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\theta_i\\, \\phi_i(s,a)$",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e1eH5oIYN0SLDS8WaI4r1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130.76315115035163,
      "y": 3000.983833550967,
      "width": 797.2154541015625,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1480353169,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 1349424671,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213314209,
      "created": 1791213309438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The vector $\\displaystyle \\theta \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ collects the **parameters** of the\napproximator (in this and in the following chapters $\\displaystyle \\theta$ always denotes the\nparameters of a value function or of a network, not the stopping tolerance of Chapter 03). From now\non, learning a value function means adjusting $\\displaystyle \\theta$, not filling cells. Two\nobservations make this **linear function approximation** the reference point for everything that\nfollows.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The vector $\\displaystyle \\theta \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ collects the **parameters** of the approximator (in this and in the following chapters $\\displaystyle \\theta$ always denotes the parameters of a value function or of a network, not the stopping tolerance of Chapter 03). From now on, learning a value function means adjusting $\\displaystyle \\theta$, not filling cells. Two observations make this **linear function approximation** the reference point for everything that follows.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Xp2c8_st2oFJb188HdsNB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 134.22717092574226,
      "y": 3130.983833550967,
      "width": 790.2874145507812,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 609433599,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 604282705,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213314209,
      "created": 1791213309438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "First, **the table is a special case**. If $\\displaystyle \\phi(s,a)$ is the one-hot vector that is\n$\\displaystyle 1$ in the position of the pair $\\displaystyle (s,a)$ and $\\displaystyle 0$ elsewhere,\nthen $\\displaystyle \\theta^\\top \\phi(s,a)$ is simply the entry $\\displaystyle \\theta_{(s,a)}$ of\nthe table: tabular methods are linear function approximation with $\\displaystyle n = \\lvert\n\\mathcal{S} \\rvert\\, \\lvert \\mathcal{A} \\rvert$ independent parameters and no generalization. With\nfewer parameters than pairs, $\\displaystyle n \\ll \\lvert \\mathcal{S} \\rvert\\, \\lvert \\mathcal{A}\n\\rvert$, pairs that share features share parameters, and an update made for one pair also changes\nthe value of every pair with similar features. This is exactly the **generalization** we need and, as\nwe will see, also the source of new difficulties.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "First, **the table is a special case**. If $\\displaystyle \\phi(s,a)$ is the one-hot vector that is $\\displaystyle 1$ in the position of the pair $\\displaystyle (s,a)$ and $\\displaystyle 0$ elsewhere, then $\\displaystyle \\theta^\\top \\phi(s,a)$ is simply the entry $\\displaystyle \\theta_{(s,a)}$ of the table: tabular methods are linear function approximation with $\\displaystyle n = \\lvert \\mathcal{S} \\rvert\\, \\lvert \\mathcal{A} \\rvert$ independent parameters and no generalization. With fewer parameters than pairs, $\\displaystyle n \\ll \\lvert \\mathcal{S} \\rvert\\, \\lvert \\mathcal{A} \\rvert$, pairs that share features share parameters, and an update made for one pair also changes the value of every pair with similar features. This is exactly the **generalization** we need and, as we will see, also the source of new difficulties.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "OSgN8urxFrLtsgypjfEql",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 298.17111013472663,
      "y": 3430.983833550967,
      "width": 462.3995361328125,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1738247025,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 60062271,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213314209,
      "created": 1791213309438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Second, **the gradient of a linear approximator is trivial**:",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Second, **the gradient of a linear approximator is trivial**:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4yyKvBYhpTHt1XXQV2mTQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 307.47509573042976,
      "y": 3490.983833550967,
      "width": 443.79156494140625,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 441049119,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 162958641,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213314209,
      "created": 1791213309438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "$\\displaystyle \\nabla_\\theta Q(s,a;\\theta) = \\phi(s,a)$",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "$\\displaystyle \\nabla_\\theta Q(s,a;\\theta) = \\phi(s,a)$",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "tOZonIhofV51pgZvyKOmo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 139.69924734175788,
      "y": 3530.983833550967,
      "width": 779.34326171875,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1876620625,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 2091440735,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791213314209,
      "created": 1791213309438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "so the incremental update pattern of the whole course, $\\displaystyle \\text{NewEstimate}\n\\leftarrow \\text{OldEstimate} + \\text{StepSize} \\times (\\text{Target} - \\text{OldEstimate})$,\nbecomes an update of the parameters in the direction of the features:",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "so the incremental update pattern of the whole course, $\\displaystyle \\text{NewEstimate} \\leftarrow \\text{OldEstimate} + \\text{StepSize} \\times (\\text{Target} - \\text{OldEstimate})$, becomes an update of the parameters in the direction of the features:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pv4z6nBT37jZR6AbDm8Bf",
